+msgstr "在上方選擇的旋轉之前，將畫面左右鏡像，與 Wayland 輸出協定的翻轉轉換相同。適用於鏡面裝置、背投投影機或提詞機。"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label size of the screen in millimetres"
+msgid "Physical size:"
+msgstr "實體尺寸："
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@info width and height of the screen in millimetres, then its diagonal in inches"
+msgid "%1 × %2 mm (%3″ diagonal)"
+msgstr "%1 × %2 mm（對角線 %3″）"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label position of the screen among the others"
+msgid "Position:"
+msgstr "位置："
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label x coordinate of the screen"
+msgid "X:"
+msgstr "X："
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label y coordinate of the screen"
+msgid "Y:"
+msgstr "Y："
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@info"
+msgid "The corner of the screen, in pixels from the top left corner of all the screens. The screen goes exactly where the numbers say, without snapping."
+msgstr "螢幕角落相對於所有螢幕左上角的像素位置。螢幕會準確放在數字所示的位置，不會吸附。"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label modes the person adds for the screen"
+msgid "Custom modes:"
+msgstr "自訂模式："
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@option:check Show the custom modes of the screen and the fields to add one"
+msgid "Add or remove custom modes"
+msgstr "新增或移除自訂模式"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@info:placeholder"
+msgid "No custom modes"
+msgstr "沒有自訂模式"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@action:button Remove this custom mode"
+msgid "Remove"
+msgstr "移除"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@action:button %1 is a custom mode"
+msgid "Remove %1"
+msgstr "移除 %1"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label width of a custom mode in pixels"
+msgid "Width"
+msgstr "寬度"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label between the width and the height of a custom mode"
+msgid "×"
+msgstr "×"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label height of a custom mode in pixels"
+msgid "Height"
+msgstr "高度"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label between the height and the refresh rate of a custom mode"
+msgid "at"
+msgstr "@"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label refresh rate of a custom mode in hertz"
+msgid "Refresh rate"
+msgstr "更新率"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@label unit of the refresh rate of a custom mode"
+msgid "Hz"
+msgstr "Hz"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@option:check Use reduced blanking timings for the new mode"
+msgid "Reduced blanking"
+msgstr "縮減消隱"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@info"
+msgid "Shorter blanking intervals, for a mode the display takes at a higher refresh rate than the usual timings allow. The compositor makes the timings of the mode when the settings are applied, and the mode then shows under Resolution."
+msgstr "更短的消隱間隔，用於顯示器在高於常規時序所允許的更新率下接受的模式。套用設定時，合成器會產生該模式的時序，之後該模式會顯示在「解析度」下。"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@action:button Add the custom mode written in the fields"
+msgid "Add"
+msgstr "新增"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@option:check Keep the name of each screen on the screen as long as the arrangement view is open"
+msgid "Show Screen Names"
+msgstr "顯示螢幕名稱"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@option:check The mouse wheel moves the view of the screen arrangement"
+msgid "Wheel Pans the View"
+msgstr "滾輪平移檢視"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@info:status Size of the screens in the arrangement view as a percentage of their size in pixels"
+msgid "Zoom %1%"
+msgstr "縮放 %1%"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@info:status %1 is the reason KWin gives"
+msgid "Screen names cannot be shown: %1"
+msgstr "無法顯示螢幕名稱：%1"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox Width, height and refresh rate of a custom mode"
+msgid "%1 × %2 at %3 Hz"
+msgstr "%1 × %2 @ %3 Hz"
+
+#. Sparky Stereo OS, the extra menus of Display Settings (wdisplays parity)
+msgctxt "@item:inlistbox A custom mode, and that it uses reduced blanking timings"
+msgid "%1, reduced blanking"
+msgstr "%1，縮減消隱"
